## Pre-push verification (wallet)

Before `git push` (or before asking the user to push) for this repository:

1. Run **`pnpm verify`** from the repo root and wait for it to finish successfully.
2. `verify` runs: `type-check`, `lint`, `test:coverage`, and `build` (see `package.json` scripts).
3. If any step fails, fix the issues and re-run `pnpm verify` until it passes; do not push a broken branch.

Use the same Node/pnpm versions as CI when possible to avoid environment drift.
